rossi (0.1.9-2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Build release binaries with profile-guided optimization (PGO):
    instrument, train on the in-repo example models, merge the profile, and
    rebuild both binaries against it, mirroring upstream's release workflow
    and the gentoo-overlay/fedora-copr rossi packages. Falls back to a plain
    build on source tags that predate scripts/pgo-train.sh.

